+// FILE: GXWorldStreamNet.h ///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
+// GeneralsX @feature ZeroHourEarth 13/11/2026 The socket under GXWorldStream.cpp.
+//
+// Kept in its own translation unit with no engine header in sight: <winsock2.h> must come before
+// <windows.h>, which half the engine's headers have already included by the time a game file is
+// compiled. Nothing here knows what a chunk is - it moves bytes to and from the world server on
+// 127.0.0.1 and converts its UTF-8 strings.
