 #define SKY_BLACK_SIDES	32
+
+// GeneralsX @feature ZeroHourEarth 13/11/2026 World Exploration's horizon. The streamed window ends a few hundred metres
+// past the camera and a free camera sees past it: black there reads as a hole in the world. While these are set (ARGB, 0 =
+// off; GXWorldStream sets them from the window's own ground) the cap below eye level is a distant land instead - haze at
+// the horizon fading into the land's colour, which then fills everything below it out to the box.
